flowchart LR
  Request[Request + trace context] --> Auth[Authority context]
  Auth --> Decision[Policy decision + PIP evidence]
  Decision --> Call[Tool/provider calls]
  Call --> Transform[Deterministic transformations]
  Transform --> Output[Output artefact/hash]
  Output --> Receipt[Result evidence receipt]
  Receipt --> Audit[(Append-only evidence store)]
  Audit --> Challenge[Reconstruction and challenge]
